@movies = http://localhost:8082
@movieId = replace-with-returned-id
@theaterId = replace-with-returned-id
@screenId = replace-with-returned-id
@showtimeId = replace-with-returned-id

### Local catalogue
GET {{movies}}/api/movies

### Import by IMDb ID (OMDB_API_KEY required on server)
POST {{movies}}/api/movies/import/tt0133093

### Mark imported movie as showing
PATCH {{movies}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}/showing
Content-Type: application/json

{"isShowing":true}

### Filter catalogue
GET {{movies}}/api/movies/search?genre=Action&language=English&isShowing=true

### Search remote metadata
GET {{movies}}/api/movies/omdb/search?title=Matrix&page=1

### Refresh imported metadata
POST {{movies}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}/refresh

### Create theater
POST {{movies}}/api/theaters
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"CinemaSaar","location":"Saar, Bahrain"}

### Create screen
POST {{movies}}/api/screens
Content-Type: application/json

{"theaterId":"{{theaterId}}","name":"Screen 1"}

### Generate physical layout BEFORE creating showtimes
POST {{movies}}/api/seats/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{"screenId":"{{screenId}}","rows":["A","B","C"],"seatsPerRow":10}

### Read physical definitions for Member 3
GET {{movies}}/api/seats/screen/{{screenId}}

### Create showtime (use a future date)
POST {{movies}}/api/showtimes
X-User-Id: local-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{"movieId":"{{movieId}}","screenId":"{{screenId}}","startsAt":"2027-01-01T15:00:00Z","endsAt":"2027-01-01T17:30:00Z","basePrice":4.50}

### Member 4 reads authoritative screening metadata
GET {{movies}}/api/showtimes/{{showtimeId}}

### Upcoming schedule
GET {{movies}}/api/showtimes/upcoming

### Protected cancellation (409 until booking guard integration is configured)
PATCH {{movies}}/api/showtimes/{{showtimeId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CANCELLED"}

### Recommendation requests moved to ../../recommendation-service/docs/requests.http

### Mark the existing Inception record as showing
PATCH {{movies}}/api/movies/6ae871d6a6456bb77994130a/showing
Content-Type: application/json

{"isShowing":true}

### Verify Inception in the complete catalogue
GET {{movies}}/api/movies

### Verify Inception in currently showing movies
GET {{movies}}/api/movies/showing
